      "message": "Dear Todd,\n\nThanks for you review.\n\nTRACE_SYSTEM is defined in xhci_trace.h(#define TRACE_SYSTEM xhci hcd),\n\nTRACE_SYSTEM is also defined in include/trace/books/usb.h (#define TRACE_SYSTEM usb),\n\ndrivers/USB/host/xhci.h(#include \"xhci.h\") is referenced in drivers/USB/host/xhci trace.h,\n\nso if use vendor hook (#include \u003ctrace/books/usb.h\u003e) in drivers/usb/host/xhci.h, it will compile fail,\n\nso we need to use _trace_android_vh_xhci_urb_suitable_bypass() to solve this problem.\n\nRefer to the submitted patch: https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/ +/2226459",
